<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0452_T02_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, youngblood! I just had SIX\nespressos and I’m WIRED! My eye\ftwitchin’!\rI need to talk to somebody, so it’s\nyou!\rI might not look like much now, but I\nwas a EXPERT at catchin’ homies!\fIn 1974!\rYou believe me? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0452_T02_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">GOOD, good! Yeah, I was somethin’ else!\nI caught a MEW once! It was a cat.\fBut still!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0452_T02_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">WHAT?! You lil PUNK!\rIf I was younger, I’d show you a thing\nor two! Hmph! *twitch* *twitch*</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0452_T02_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This Block ain’t had a Boss for a\nwhile...\rA young man from Pallet Town became\nBoss, but he gone ALL the time. Remote\fwork.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0452_T02_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">How’d it go? You get to scrap the Boss?\nOr was he out “findin’ himself” again?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0452_T02_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">*yawn*! Musta dozed off in the sun.\r...I dreamed a DROWZEE was eatin’ my\ndream. While I was IN it. That’s\ftrippy.\fHuh? What’s this?\rWhere this TM come from?! This SPOOKY!\nHere, you take it. I don’t want no\fhaunted TM in my pocket!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0452_T02_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">TM85 is Dream Killer...\n...Zzzzz...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0452_T02_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I heard there’s mad stuff on the\nground in Viridian Forest. And bugs.\fMAD bugs.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0452_T02_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Viridian City\nThe City of Evergreen</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0452_T02_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Viridian City Block\nBoss: ...\fThe Rest Got Scratched Off...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0452_T02_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome to Viridian City,\nthe Gateway to Indigo Plateau!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0452_T02_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hustler House\nThe Club for Top Hustler Scraps</language>
	</row>
</body>
